adjudication.rationale:
In `packages/core/EventManager.ts`, the diff changes `destinationCalendar` to an array and introduces:
```ts
const [mainHostDestinationCalendar] = evt.destinationCalendar ?? [];
if (evt.location === MeetLocationType && mainHostDestinationCalendar.integration !== "google_calendar") {
  ...
}
```
If `evt.destinationCalendar` is `undefined`, `null`, or an empty array, `mainHostDestinationCalendar` will be `undefined`. Accessing `mainHostDestinationCalendar.integration` is unguarded and will throw a `TypeError`. This can occur specifically for Google Meet bookings (`evt.location === MeetLocationType`) that have no destination calendar, matching the finding.
